{"schema":"dasa_pada_text","default_author":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","count":24,"bio_notes":"","items":[{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6196","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಎಷ್ಟು ಆನಂದವೊ ಶ್ರೀಹರಿಯ","latin":"","iast":"èṣṭu ānaṃdavò śrīhariya","devanagari":"ऎष्टु आनंदवॊ श्रीहरिय"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["(ಅ) ಶ್ರೀಹರಿಸ್ತುತಿ","ಎಷ್ಟು ಆನಂದವೊ ಶ್ರೀಹರಿಯ ಭಜನೆ ಪ","ದುಷ್ಟತರ ದೋಷಗಳು ಬಳಲುವ","ಕಷ್ಟಗಳ ಪರಿಹರಿಸಿ ಸರ್ವೋ","ತ್ಕøಷ್ಟ ಪದವಿಯ ಕೊಡುವ ಲಕ್ಷ್ಮೀ","ಇಷ್ಟನಾರಾಯಣನ ಭಜನೆ","ಪದ್ಮದಳನಯನ ಪ್ರತಿಷ್ಠೆಯ","ಪದ್ಮಶಾಲಿಯ ಭಕ್ತರೆಲ್ಲರು","ಪದ್ಮನಾಭನ ಪ್ರೀತಿಮಾಡಿ ಸು","ಭದ್ರಸಂಪದ್ಯುಕ್ತರಾದರು","ಮಂದಿರವು ಕಟ್ಟಿಸಿಯು ಪರಮಾ","ನಂದದಿಂ ಉತ್ಸವವು ನಡಿಸಿದ","ರೆಂದು ಕೇಳಿದ ಭಾಗ್ಯಶಾಲಿಗಳು","ಇಂದಿರೇಶನ ಕೃಪೆಯ ಪಡೆದರು","ಅಂಬುಜೋದರದಾಸರೆಲ್ಲರು","ತಂಬುರೆಯು ಕರತಾಳವಾದ್ಯವಿ","ಜೃಂಭಿಸಿ ಹರಿಸ್ಮರಣೆಯ ಮಾಡುತ","ಸಂಭ್ರಮದಿ ಬಂದವರು ನೋಡಲು","ವಾಸುಕೀನಗರೇಶ ದಾಸರ","ದಾಸರಾಗಿಯು ತುಲಸಿರಾಮ","ದಾಸ ಪರಮೋಲ್ಲಾಸದಿಂ ಶ್ರೀ","ವಾಸುದೇವನ ಚರಣನಂಬಿದೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":25,"keerthana_id":6196,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":[],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6197","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಕಮಲನಾಭ ವೆಂಕಟೇಶ ಭಕ್ತ","latin":"","iast":"kamalanābha vèṃkaṭeśa bhakta","devanagari":"कमलनाभ वॆंकटेश भक्त"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಕಮಲನಾಭ ವೆಂಕಟೇಶ ಭಕ್ತ ಕಲ್ಪಭೂರುಹ ಶ್ರೀ","ಕಮಲ ಪ್ರಾಣೇಶಾ ಪ","ವಿಮಲ ವೈಕುಂಠಪುರೀಶಾ ಶಿವ","ಕಮಲಸಂಭವನುತ ಕರ್ಬುರನಾಶಾ ಅ.ಪ","ನಿರುಪಮ ಸುಂದರ ಗಾತ್ರಾ ನಿತ್ಯ","ಪರಿಪೂರ್ಣ ವೈಭವ ಪರಮ ಪವಿತ್ರಾ","ಶರನಿಧಿ ತನಯ ಕಳತ್ರಾ ಶೇಷ","ಪರಿಜನಕೃತ ಘೋರ ಪಾಪಾಂಧ ಮಿತ್ರಾ","ಸನಕ ಸನಂದನ ವಿನುತಾ ಶಶಿ","ದಿನಕರ ಶತಕೋಟಿ ದಿವ್ಯ ಸುಚರಿತಾ","ಜನನ ಮರಣ ಕ್ಲೇಶರಹಿತ ಶ್ರೀ","ವನಜ ಸುದರ್ಶನ ವನಮಾಲ ಧರಿತ","ಜಲಜಮಿತ್ರ ವಂಶ ಭೂಷಾ ಕ್ಷಾರ","ಜಲಧಿ ಬಂಧನ ಪುಣ್ಯಜನ ಪ್ರಾಣ ಶೋಷಾ","ತುಲಸೀ ರಾಮದಾಸ ಪೋಷಾ ಶ್ರೀ","ತುಲಸೀ ಕಾನನಹಿತ ತುಂಬುರ ತೋಷಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":25,"keerthana_id":6197,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":[],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6198","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಜಯ ಶ್ರೀಧರಾರಮಣ ಜಯ","latin":"","iast":"jaya śrīdharāramaṇa jaya","devanagari":"जय श्रीधरारमण जय"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಜಯ ಶ್ರೀಧರಾರಮಣ ಜಯ ಕೌಸ್ತುಭಾಭರಣ ಪ","ಜಯ ದುರಿತನಿಧಿತರಣ","ಜಯ ಪದ್ಮಚರಣಾ ಜಯಜಯಾ ಅ.ಪ","ಜಯ ಪುಂಡರೀಕಾಕ್ಷ ಜಯ ತ್ರಿಭುವನಾಧ್ಯಕ್ಷ","ಜಯ ಪಾಂಡುಸುತ ಪಕ್ಷ ಜಯ ಜಗದ್ರಕ್ಷಾ ಜಯಜಯಾ","ಜಯ ಲೋಕಭಯನಾಶ ಜಯ ದಳಿತಭವಪಾಶ","ಜಯ ವೇಂಕಟಾದ್ರೀಶ ಜಯಸುಪ್ರಕಾಶ ಜಯಜಯಾ","ಜಯ ತುಲಸೀದಳ ದಾಮ ಜಯ ಶೇಷಗಿರಿಧಾಮ","ಜಯದೈತ್ಯರಿಪುಭೀಮ ಜಯಕೃಷ್ಣರಾಮಾ ಜಯಜಯಾ","ಜಯ ಕೋಟಿರವಿಭಾಸ ಜಯ ಸಾತ್ವಿಕೋಲ್ಲಾಸ","ಜಯ ಜಯ ಭವದ್ದಾಸ ಜಯ ಶ್ರೀನಿವಾಸಾ ಜಯ ಜಯಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":25,"keerthana_id":6198,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":[],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6199","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ದರಿಶಕುಪ್ಪ ಶ್ರೀ ಅಂಜನಿ ತನಯ","latin":"","iast":"dariśakuppa śrī aṃjani tanaya","devanagari":"दरिशकुप्प श्री अंजनि तनय"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["() ದರಿಶಕುಪ್ಪ (ಶ್ರೀರಂಗಪಟ್ಟಣದ ಸಮೀಪ)","ದರಿಶಕುಪ್ಪ ಶ್ರೀ ಅಂಜನಿ ತನಯ","ದರುಶನ ಕೊಡು ಬೇಗ ದಯದಿಂದಾ ಪ","ಸಿರಿ ರಘುಕುಲವರ ಸೇವಾನುಕೂಲ","ಸ್ಮರಿಸುವೆ ನಿಮ್ಮ ಪಾದಸರಸಿಜಯುಗಳ","ಹರಿಹರ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮಾದ್ಯಮರ ಸುಪೂಜ","ಧರಣಿಜಾ ಪ್ರಾಣೋದ್ಧಾರ ಸುತೇಜ","ಘೋರದುರಿತ ಪರಿಹಾರ ಕಪೀಶಾ","ಪಾರಿಜಾತ ತರು ಪ್ರಾಂತ್ಯನಿವೇಶಾ","ಲವಣ ಜಲಧಿ ಪದಲಂಘನ ತುಂಗ","ಪವನಾತ್ಮಜ ರಿಪುಭಂಗ ಶುಭಾಂಗ","ರಾಮಾನುಜ ಪ್ರಾಣರಕ್ಷಣ ದೀಕ್ಷಾ","ಕಾಮಾದ್ಯವಗುಣ ಖಂಡನಾಧ್ಯಕ್ಷ","ಮರಕತ ಮಣಿಮಯ ಮಂಜುಳ ಭೂಷಾ","ಧರೆಯೊಳ್ ತುಲಸೀದಾಸ ಸುಪೋಷಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":25,"keerthana_id":6199,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":[],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6200","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ನಮೋ ನಮೋ ಭವಗತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ನಾರಾಯಣಿ","latin":"","iast":"namo namo bhavagati śrī nārāyaṇi","devanagari":"नमो नमो भवगति श्री नारायणि"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ನಮೋ ನಮೋ ಭವಗತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ನಾರಾಯಣಿ ಜಗದೀಶ್ವರೀ ಪ","ಸುಮಶರಜನನೀ ಸೋಮ ಸಹೋದರಿ","ಕಮಲವಾಸಿನೀ ಸುಂದರೀ ಲಕ್ಷ್ಮೀ ಅ.ಪ","ವಿಮಲಾ ವಿಶ್ವಕುಟುಂಬಿನೀ ವೆಂಕಟಶೈಲ ನಿವಾಸಿನೀ","ಅಮರೇಂದ್ರಾರ್ಚಿತ ಪಾದ ಸರಸಿಜ","ಅಘವಿನಾಶಿನಿ ಅಖಿಲಾಪದಹರ","ಅಮೋಘ ಸಂಪತ್ಪ್ರದಾಯನೀ ಆರ್ತರಕ್ಷ ದೀಕ್ಷಾಮಣೀ","ಪ್ರಮೋದಯಾ ಶ್ರೀರಮಾಭಾರ್ಗವೀ","ಮಮಾಪಚಾರ ಕ್ಷಮಸ್ವಶಾರ್ಚಿಣೀ","ಹೇಮಕುಧರ ಧಾಮೇಶ್ವರಿ","ತುಲಸಿರಾಮದಾಸನುತ ರಾಜೀವಾಕ್ಷಾ","ಹಿಮಾಂಶು ಮುಖ ಹರಿಹಿತಪ್ರಿಯ","ನಿಸ್ಸೀಮಾನದಾನಿನಿ ಸಜ್ಜನ ಪೋಷಿಣಿ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":25,"keerthana_id":6200,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":[],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"tulasiramadasaru__dasa1_6201","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಪರಮದೇಶಿಕ ಮಾವಿನೋದಾ ದಿವ್ಯ","latin":"","iast":"paramadeśika māvinodā divya","devanagari":"परमदेशिक माविनोदा दिव्य"},"composer":"ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"tuḻasīrāmadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ತುಳಸೀರಾಮದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಪರಮದೇಶಿಕ ಮಾವಿನೋದಾ ದಿವ್ಯ","ಪರಮಾರ್ಥಮುನು ವೇಗಾ-ಬೋಧಿಂಚರಾದಾ ಪ","ಸುರಮುನೀಂದ್ರ ವಿಚಾರ-ಸೋಹಮಸ್ಮಿಧಿಯೇರಾ","ವರಮುಲಡಗಿತಿನಿಚ್ಚಿ-ದಾರಿದೇರ್ಚುಕೋರಾ","ನೀದು ಶೇವಕುಡೈತಿ-ನಿಚ್ಚಯಿಂಚಿನ ಚಾಲೂ","ವಾದಿ ಭೀಕರು ಡೈನ-ವೈಷ್ಣವಾಗ್ರಜುಡೇ","ಆಳ್ವಾರೆಂಬೇರುಮಾನಾರ್ ಜೀಯರ್ ಸ್ವಾಮುಲೆ ಗಾದಾ","ತಾಳ್ವೋಯ ಚೂಡಿದಿ ಯನುಚು ಪಾಲಿಂಚಲೇದಾ","ಮಂತ್ರಜ್ಞಾನ ರಹಸ್ಯಮಂತ್ಯಮಾದಿಗ ಜೂಪೆ","ಅಂತರಂ